{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10122020","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10122020","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1012202001:1":{"text":"ねえ、道これであってる？ここが恋人たちの祈りなの？","source_cn":"我们是不是走错路了？这里怎么可能是情人之愿呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2042E786B48DB767","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1012202002:1":{"text":"こんな恐ろしい場所、仇人（あだびと）の祈りって呼んだ方がしっくりくるよ。ターラン村よりも地面の腐敗が酷い！","source_cn":"这么可怕的地方，叫仇人之愿才对吧！地面的腐化竟然比塔兰...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x535C93DC8F9A5292","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1012202003:1":{"text":"魔力の流れは地脈に左右される。複雑に入り組んだ川のように、流れを把握するのは難しい。","source_cn":"地脉决定了魔力的流动，它就像错综复杂的河流，难以摸清走势。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B0D2A337BD4B15B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1012202004:1":{"text":"どうやら、ここの地脈は流光の樹と直に繋がっているようだ。だからより強く影響を受けているんだろう。","source_cn":"看来，这里的地脉与流荧树直接相连，因此受到的影响也更加明显。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFE6A2DD02C2FFFD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1012202005:1":{"text":"カイムばあちゃんが言ってたイヴォンヌさんはまだここにいるのかな？住んでる場所がこんなになっちゃってるのに……","source_cn":"茴姆婆婆提到的那位伊温小姐呢？情人之愿都变成这样了……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69C1FC95FB222F29","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1012202006:1":{"text":"いる。まだ雨は止んでいないからな。","source_cn":"她在，因为雨没有停。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD5691FFA2F5C1DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1012202007:1":{"text":"ええ、暖かい雨。まるで心の雑念を洗い流してくれるよう……","source_cn":"是啊，好温暖的雨。这场雨仿佛能洗净心中所有杂念。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x094E8E21DC1C6323","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1012202008:1":{"text":"でも、いったいどこにいるんだ？近くに人影なんて見えないぞ。","source_cn":"可是……她在哪呢？这附近连个人影都看不着。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x45C038A5091436A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1012202009:1":{"text":"名前でも呼んでみる？でもカイムばあちゃんが彼女は臆病だって言ったから、逆に怖がらせちゃうかなぁ？","source_cn":"我们喊她的名字试试？但茴姆婆婆说她很胆小，这么做会不会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25551A588D7B25B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1012202010:1":{"text":"軽率な行動は控えた方がいい。","source_cn":"我建议，不要轻举妄动。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA5A48A1C32068E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1012202011:1":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">湖の真ん中にある東屋</style>から強力な魔力を感じる。まずはあそこに行ってみよう。","source_cn":"<style=highlight>湖心那座亭子里</s...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FD110D2ACFBCC58","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"クイン","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:埃隆":{"text":"エルロン","source":"埃隆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:布莱恩":{"text":"ブライアン","source":"布莱恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"ライカ","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":12,"localized_text_count":11,"speaker_count":4}}